{{!-- A Season's "+ Add": a new entry dated to that Season, on the thread whose lane it's in or the sheet's own. Shown while its Season is hovered or it has the keyboard, always on a touch screen and in the Season it is now when that holds nothing yet; it keeps its room while hidden, so showing it never moves a card. --}}
<button type="button" class="bastionland-button bastionland-timeline__add" data-action="timeline" data-timeline="addHere" data-season="{{season}}" data-timeline-focus="add-{{season}}-{{trackId}}" aria-label="{{label}}" data-tooltip="{{label}}"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus" inert></i> {{localize "bastionland.timeline.add"}}</button>
